  "details": "The new update seems to have changed something to do with how worlds and avatars load. Now joining and loading worlds after the download of them has finished takes a very long. And when someone joins a world or changes their avatar the game freezes and drops frame-rate for a few seconds. I have also noted that in task-manager that the CPU and RAM-usage has gone upquite a lot. Several friends have reported similar experiences, at least with people chaning avatars. \nI'm hoping to see some improvement in this regard as I now get nausious playing VR due to the sudden fps-spikes and lower fps.",
